    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n# \n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/d089a1f2511cf336fcbe4e0cf37fe628.svg) ⟨28⟩\nOsamaAbdeljaber⟨28⟩\n/\nboard-generator-knot-model⟨29⟩\nlike 0\n numpy ⟨30⟩ wood ⟨31⟩ simulation ⟨32⟩ knot-generation ⟨33⟩ board-generator ⟨34⟩\n Model card ⟨29⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨35⟩ Community ⟨36⟩\nCopy to bucket new\n  * Board Generator Knot Sequence Model⟨37⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨37⟩ Board Generator Knot Sequence Model \nThis repository contains the trained knot sequence generator used by the Board Generator demo.\nFiles:\n  * `knot_sequence_model.pt`: original PyTorch LSTM checkpoint.\n  * `knot_sequence_model.npz`: NumPy-exported LSTM checkpoint used by the CPU Hugging Face Space.\n  * `knot_sequence_model.json`: metadata for the trained knot sequence model.\n  * `training_data_new_2025.mat`: knot dictionary and tokenized sequence data used by Board Generator to map sampled tokens to knot parameters.\n\n\nThe model generates stochastic knot-token sequences. Board Generator then maps those tokens to geometric knot parameters for synthetic log, board, and veneer generation. Downloads last month\n    \n-     \nDownloads are not tracked for this model. How to track ⟨38⟩\nInference Providers NEW⟨39⟩\nThis model isn't deployed by any Inference Provider. 🙋 Ask for provider support⟨40⟩\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨41⟩ Privacy⟨42⟩ About⟨43⟩ Careers⟨44⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\nInference providers allow you to run inference using different serverless providers.\n",
